When wiping the ice maker interior cavity, water distribution tube, water curtain, and white inner door liner, staff MUST use a **clean red-edged towel taken fresh from the dedicated labeled sanitizing bucket**:
- 🔴 Towel not taken from the dedicated labeled sanitizing bucket (e.g., left on the sink rim, counter, machine top, or faucet and reused) → RED_LINE violation;
- 🔴 Cross-using red, blue, and yellow color-coded towels (e.g., wiping the ice maker interior liner with a blue-edged bar towel or yellow-edged utensil towel) → RED_LINE violation.
